                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very poor quality Link to the Past clone but even worse visuals and controls despite the benefit of nearly 35 years of gaming evolution. If you want a Zelda clone at least try Neutopia or maybe Blossoms Quest 1/2, Oceans Heart, or Prodigal if you want an indie developer. \n\nGame economy is way out of whack too: 20 for an apple (which heals a paltry 1 heart), 30 for the inn (which you're forced to stay at, at the start with around 100 total currency at that point), 50 for the sword course which you HAVE TO DO for the bow when bushes are sometimes giving you just 1. Just no.",
